    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Zombiefield operations!</strong> Your contract is simple: activate enough portals to lure in the toughest zombies and evacuate before the missile strike. Follow these rules to complete your mission and get paid:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Paid Objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Open portals (Based on threat level)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Restore power (Based on threat level)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Control zombie population if necessary ($1 per body)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Complete the contract ($1000 upon evacuation procedure)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommendations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 1\u00a0<strong>Manager</strong>\u00a0(beard, one life) leads and is responsible for operations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Up to 3\u00a0<strong>Employees</strong> (shaved, unlimited respawn)<strong>\u00a0</strong>should protect Manager at all costs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f No place is safe. Stick together and stay moving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Research shows that teamwork increases survival chances by 8%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Portals and power outlets raises your hazard pay but also increases threat levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Do not take teammates' ammuniition from drop deliveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Injuries during mission time and required supplies will not be compensated</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons to keep the field clear of zombies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open portals and\u00a0restore power to bring tougher zombies into the field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the threat level reaches its peak, the company will send evacuation transport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a Manager dies, the operation contract becomes void</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hazard pay</strong> for tasks, plus extra for each zombie you defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong> to buy from a variety of single-shot and automatic models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call for helicopter delivery</strong> and get items right to your front doorway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New zombie species</strong> are attracted through portals, increasing their quantity and difficulty</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Zombiefield operations!</strong> Your contract is simple: activate enough portals to lure in the toughest zombies and evacuate before the missile strike. Follow these rules to complete your mission and get paid:</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Paid Objectives</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Open portals (Based on threat level)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Restore power (Based on threat level)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Control zombie population if necessary ($1 per body)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Complete the contract ($1000 upon evacuation procedure)</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Recommendations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 1\u00a0<strong>Manager</strong>\u00a0(beard, one life) leads and is responsible for operations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc65 Up to 3\u00a0<strong>Employees</strong> (shaved, unlimited respawn)<strong>\u00a0</strong>should protect Manager at all costs</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Important Notes</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f No place is safe. Stick together and stay moving</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Research shows that teamwork increases survival chances by 8%</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Portals and power outlets raises your hazard pay but also increases threat levels</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Do not take teammates' ammuniition from drop deliveries</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u26a0\ufe0f Injuries during mission time and required supplies will not be compensated</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAMEPLAY:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use weapons to keep the field clear of zombies</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Open portals and\u00a0restore power to bring tougher zombies into the field</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once the threat level reaches its peak, the company will send evacuation transport</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If a Manager dies, the operation contract becomes void</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hazard pay</strong> for tasks, plus extra for each zombie you defeat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons</strong> to buy from a variety of single-shot and automatic models</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Call for helicopter delivery</strong> and get items right to your front doorway</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New zombie species</strong> are attracted through portals, increasing their quantity and difficulty</p></li></ul>",
